Package: cynitor-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OpenCyphal-Garage <https://github.com/OpenCyphal-Garage/cynitor>
Depends: libc6
Conflicts: cynitor
Replaces: cynitor
Description: Cyphal network monitor
 Serves the Cynitor dashboard together with its REST and WebSocket API for
 monitoring Cyphal (UAVCAN) networks over CAN bus.
 .
 Everything is inside one executable: no Python installation is required, and
 clients need only a browser. Start the service or run cynitor-server
 directly, then open the address it prints.
